{{- /* dreamteam.alternatives-presentation/v2: fixed text. Both arms get "head" and "foot", the same text byte for byte at one decision point; the treatment adds "comparison" between them and answers inspect with "detail". Every value is a typed field of the view (dreamteam.alternatives-view/v1). */ -}}
{{define "head" -}}
FINAL DECISION at {{.Time}}. The staffing actions in your reply passed validation: the simulator would accept them now. Nothing has been applied yet.
{{end}}
{{- define "comparison"}}
ALTERNATIVES. The simulator's alternatives to the staffing actions in your reply, in a fixed order: your proposal, no action, then any others the candidate rule lists. The order says nothing about any alternative, and none is a default.
{{- range .Refs}}
{{.ID}} is {{refText .}}.
{{- end}}
{{range .Alternatives}}
{{.ID}}{{if eq .ID "proposal"}} (your proposal){{end}}: {{actions .}}
  Validation: {{validation .}}
{{- end}}

Each alternative's detail gives the simulator's facts and estimates for it, the obligations that continue, its reversibility, and what is not known before deciding. To see details before deciding, reply {"inspect": [ID, ...]}. You can do this once.
{{end}}
{{- define "foot"}}
Reply with one JSON object:
- {"decision": "select", "id": ID, "reason": TEXT} submits the staffing actions of the listed alternative with that ID, unchanged. Your proposal's ID is "proposal".
- {"decision": "revise", "actions": [...], "reason": TEXT} replaces your whole reply with these actions; they are validated again before anything is submitted.
- {"decision": "abandon", "reason": TEXT} submits nothing.
{{- if .Operations}}
Your reply's operations actions ({{.Operations}}) are submitted unchanged with "select"; "revise" replaces them too, and "abandon" submits none of them.
{{- end}}
Optionally add "cite": up to three items from any detail you were shown, each {"item": KEY, "values": {ID: VALUE, ...}}, with the values as shown. The reason is recorded as text.
{{end}}
{{- define "detail" -}}
DETAIL {{.ID}}{{if eq .ID "proposal"}} (your proposal){{end}}: {{actions .}}
  Validation: {{validation .}}
  Facts:
{{- range .Facts}}
    - [{{.Key}}] {{line .}}
{{- else}}
    - none
{{- end}}
  Estimates:
{{- range .Estimates}}
    - [{{.Key}}] {{line .}}
{{- else}}
    - none
{{- end}}
  Obligations that continue:
{{- range .Obligations}}
    - [{{.Key}}] {{line .}}
{{- else}}
    - none listed
{{- end}}
  Reversibility: {{reversibility .}}
  Not known before deciding:
{{- range .Unavailable}}
    - {{unavailable .}}
{{- else}}
    - none listed
{{- end}}
{{end}}
{{- define "inspect_answer"}}{{range .}}{{.}}
{{end}}Reply with your decision, one JSON object as described above.
{{end}}
{{- define "inspect_unlisted"}}No alternative with that ID is listed. Reply with your decision, one JSON object as described above.
{{end}}
{{- define "inspect_control"}}There are no details to inspect. Reply with your decision, one JSON object as described above.
{{end}}
{{- define "inspect_again"}}Details can be requested only once. Reply with your decision, one JSON object as described above.
{{end}}
{{- define "retry"}}Your reply could not be read as one JSON object of the form described above. Reply again with one JSON object.
{{end}}
